## Orchestration

This repo uses the `develop` plugin. Run `/develop:work <spec | ticket | idea>` to take a
change from spec to a reviewed, committed branch, then `/develop:ship` to push it and babysit
the PR through CI and review to merge. Config: `.claude/develop.config.json`. Re-run
`/develop:bootstrap` to refresh discovered settings.
